    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>You call their name as they fall and speak the next line of their story. Their hand closes on their weapon again.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Reaction</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>None (no roll)</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>One willing ally within 4 squares who hears you when it enters Dying.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Skill</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>The ally may immediately spend 1 of its own Grit to regain full HP.</p></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/25b80c9fe77d7baaec3f3a8a548c9663d0f39a30/design/cards/the-tale-will-tell-of-you.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/the-tale-will-tell-of-you.md</a> at <code>25b80c9fe77d7baaec3f3a8a548c9663d0f39a30</code>.</p></section>",
